            "review_title": "Review at Pin Wei",
            "review_text": "samuel\nSingapore, Singapore1 contribution\n0\nMichelin-quality food near Ben Thanh Market! Tasty, affordable, and comfy with AC. Don’t miss the crispy pork skin!\nJul 2025 • Friends\nAmazing food and great value!\nStumbled upon this spot near Ben Thanh Market and was so impressed! The food was incredible — definitely feels Michelin-worthy but without the crazy price tag.\n\nLoved that it’s got air conditioning (a nice break from the heat!) and super tasty dishes. I had the prawn main with pork skin topping, crispy wonton, and herbal jelly — everything was delicious. The pork skin topping was a total winner, highly recommend adding it!\n\nWould absolutely come back again. Great find in the city! Must visit if around Ben Thanh Market.\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2025",
